      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haleburg%2C_Alabama"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The area that became Haleburg was first settled in the late 1810s, with pioneers like Randolph Blackshear establishing early schools, churches, and businesses.",
